# Plausible Analytics domain (e.g. pasaz.org), used at build time by
# BaseLayout.astro to include the tracking script. Cookieless, no consent
# banner required. Leave unset to ship with no analytics at all — nothing
# breaks either way. Sign up (or self-host) at https://plausible.io, add the
# site there first, then set this to the exact domain you registered.
PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=
